      "content": "idk i feel like you're being way too cautious. the blisters aren't even popping or anything, they just look angry. if i just use a really high concentration of the tea tree oil, wouldn't that just act like a natural antiseptic? it seems dumb to pay a co-pay just for some bandage and cream when i have stuff at home that actually works. just tell me if it's actually dangerous or if you're just being overly careful. i'm pretty much sure i can handle a little redness on my own.",
